              "2044161200859219920"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 34
        }
      ],
      "pid": "CrnLgITw",
      "text": "* 她曾试图花大钱策反一名即将离校的同学帮忙报信，但对方反悔，因为“这里对我很重要”"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 72,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 42,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044221719779488381"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "h7dW2tTq",
      "text": "* 女友被抓手机被控制，用异常语气（称呼“宝宝”）给男友发消息，男友产生怀疑，于当天下午报警。当晚，男友通过iPad耳机位置发现女友已离开北京。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 34,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 115,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044134918003983200"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 18
        }
      ],
      "pid": "xxzzDw3O",
      "text": "* 之后，男友返回北京继续报警，得到警方“人身安全没问题”的模糊答复。之后，他决定自己调查本案"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 59,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 62,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044730157341094853"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 35
        }
      ],
      "pid": "o9oyi0Y4",
      "text": "* 男友以“非法拘禁”为由正式报案，律师刘泽鑫介入。警方传唤女友父母，男友看到女友被迫录制的“分手视频”，坚信她被胁迫"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 16,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 49,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2045254380874617619"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 2
        },
        {
          "end_index": 28,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 77,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2045206310082327511"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 17
        }
      ],
      "pid": "-j7nT3yl",
      "text": "* 女友父母无意中漏出“什么峡”，男友虚空锁定河南三门峡"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 17,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 31,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044448236312735808"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 10
        },
        {
          "end_index": 27,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 19,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044150831314995068"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 18
        }
      ],
      "pid": "chhQt_-8",
      "text": "* 开了一夜车的男友虚空抵达三门峡，先排查了另一家机构，之后男友虚空在励萱教育门口看到素伶表哥的车，但被女友家长骗离"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 54,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 129,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044035239509586872"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 2
        }
      ],
      "pid": "61sDAyy1",
      "text": "* 男友火速赶到门外，但被亲戚阻拦。关键时刻，女友从屋内冲出，二人抱在一起，在随后的混乱和警方介入下重获安全"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 68,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 87,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044035270509687548"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 45
        }
      ],
      "pid": "XhY-bZLY",
      "text": "* 逃出生天后，该女生收到母亲发来的、明显用AI生成的道歉信，之后母亲说“眼睛快哭瞎了”“快死了，我AI编一下，我自己再加点话不行吗？”"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 64,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 112,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044221932191712298"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 2
        }
      ],
      "pid": "KCpMG66b",
      "text": "* 父亲再次恢复无法沟通的状态，且变本加厉，开始不断发信息辱骂女儿：骂她“傻逼”“蠢货”“性饥渴”，说她“比KTV的小姐都便宜”"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 55,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 241,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044040178663166341"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "qF03Lki-",
      "text": "* 五一之后，该女生收到北京市公安局通州分局的不立案通知书。警方认为，素伶遭到非法拘禁一事，“没有犯罪事实”。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 22,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 49,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044848078897805282"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "rd3-HVzR",
      "text": "看到这里，我想请大家先喘口气，然后我们继续。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 76,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 87,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044035404320462434"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "1vPLRsCz",
      "text": "缅北电诈与本文中的“励萱教育”学校，本质是同一种犯罪模式的不同变体。二者的核心逻辑完全一致：将人的尊严彻底剥夺，通过制造创伤来制造服从，最终目的是牟利。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 56,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 34,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044453852515128867"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 40
        }
      ],
      "pid": "JVVdIQ0B",
      "text": "王星被解救，让人们看到了缅北电诈园区的冰山一角；这个21岁女生逃离励萱教育，同样撕开了一个庞大灰色产业链的遮羞布。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 139,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 71,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044757272979625392"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "5BnXu5Bm",
      "text": "家长对“问题孩子”的焦虑、控制欲，是一个巨大的市场。动辄数万元的学费，是赤裸裸的暴利诱惑。不仅是“励萱教育”这一间屋子需要清理，而是整个滋生这类机构的土壤——扭曲的家庭教育观、对成年子女的控制欲、将暴力规训美化为“矫正”的文化、以及监管的长期失语——都已经严重污染，爬满了蟑螂。"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 61,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 17,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044695873033172726"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 46
        }
      ],
      "pid": "iOmCZyS8",
      "text": "缅北园区背后有地方武装充当保护伞，而励萱教育的“保护伞”似乎更为隐蔽，难以找到。不过我相信，正义也许会迟到，但绝不会缺席。总有一天，这些保护伞会被连根拔除！！！"
    },
    {
      "marks": [
        {
          "end_index": 18,
          "seg_info": {
            "comment_count": 0,
            "is_like": false,
            "is_span": false,
            "like_count": 47,
            "my_comment_count": 0,
            "seg_ids": [
              "2044737882846495876"
            ]
          },
          "start_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "pid": "9196Rz5q",
      "text": "结束人道主义灾难，我有责任，你也有。"
    }
